    "detailed_description": "The Dragon Army, commanded by the ruthless Drake Emperor Tiberius, marches ever closer to total conquest of the world. The once-mighty nations stand divided, each struggling in isolation as their lands fall one by one under the growing shadow of the army. Amid the chaos, a young man named Helio, from the humble village of Haven, faces his end in a vicious dragon attack. However, just as hope fades, a mysterious power awakens within him\u2014the legendary &quot;Skill Taker&quot;. Now, Helio must harness this ability to turn the tide of war, acquiring his enemies' strengths to fight back against an unstoppable force.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEngage in strategic, turn-based combat with a front-view command system that emphasizes exploiting enemy weaknesses in a fantasy RPG with beautiful pixel and anime-styled characters. As Helio, use the unique &quot;Skill Taker&quot; ability to steal and equip powerful skills from defeated foes, giving you the freedom to build and customize your arsenal. Master the art of anticipating enemy moves, unleashing devastating counterattacks, and outmaneuvering even the fiercest opponents. With each battle, you'll grow stronger and unlock new strategies, guiding Helio from a simple villager to a key player in the fight for the world's survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Ability &quot;Skill Taker&quot;<br />\r\nAn ability granted only to the protagonist, Helio, allowing him to acquire enemy skills.<br />\r\nSet the acquired skills freely and fight.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Command Battles<br />\r\nTurn-based, front-view command battles.<br />\r\nStrike the enemy\u2019s weaknesses precisely and gain the upper hand in battle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Advance on a path with no retreat!<br />\r\nAn extreme battle where escape is not an option.<br />\r\nGather precious equipment and items from treasure chests or enemy encounters, and fight with your own skills to the end.",
    "about_the_game": "The Dragon Army, commanded by the ruthless Drake Emperor Tiberius, marches ever closer to total conquest of the world. The once-mighty nations stand divided, each struggling in isolation as their lands fall one by one under the growing shadow of the army. Amid the chaos, a young man named Helio, from the humble village of Haven, faces his end in a vicious dragon attack. However, just as hope fades, a mysterious power awakens within him\u2014the legendary &quot;Skill Taker&quot;. Now, Helio must harness this ability to turn the tide of war, acquiring his enemies' strengths to fight back against an unstoppable force.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEngage in strategic, turn-based combat with a front-view command system that emphasizes exploiting enemy weaknesses in a fantasy RPG with beautiful pixel and anime-styled characters. As Helio, use the unique &quot;Skill Taker&quot; ability to steal and equip powerful skills from defeated foes, giving you the freedom to build and customize your arsenal. Master the art of anticipating enemy moves, unleashing devastating counterattacks, and outmaneuvering even the fiercest opponents. With each battle, you'll grow stronger and unlock new strategies, guiding Helio from a simple villager to a key player in the fight for the world's survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Ability &quot;Skill Taker&quot;<br />\r\nAn ability granted only to the protagonist, Helio, allowing him to acquire enemy skills.<br />\r\nSet the acquired skills freely and fight.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Command Battles<br />\r\nTurn-based, front-view command battles.<br />\r\nStrike the enemy\u2019s weaknesses precisely and gain the upper hand in battle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Advance on a path with no retreat!<br />\r\nAn extreme battle where escape is not an option.<br />\r\nGather precious equipment and items from treasure chests or enemy encounters, and fight with your own skills to the end.",
    "short_description": "Rise and resist the dragons in a fantasy RPG acquiring enemy skills!",
